  "summary": "The identified studies apply graph-based methods, specifically message passing over relational graphs, to the task of early prediction of septic deterioration. Chen et al. (2020) [V0003] report the highest accuracy at 0.74 using the LedgerGuard dataset. Adebayo et al. (2018) [V0001] achieved an AUROC of 0.6 on the Atlas-ICU dataset. Brennan et al. (2019) [V0002] utilized AgriSat-4 data, reporting an F1 score of 0.67. Duarte et al. (2021) [V0004] applied the method to the CellLife dataset, reporting an MAE of 0.81. Additionally, Duarte et al. (2021) [V0013] evaluated boosted decision-tree ensembles for the same topic on Atlas-ICU, which is included as a relevant comparative study on the same clinical prediction task.",
